<title>UK: Commerzbank sets warrants on currency pairs.</title>
<headline>Commerzbank sets warrants on currency pairs.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Commerzbank AG has issued 10 million American-style warrants, in 16 equal tranches, on the sterling/mark rate, the lire/mark rate and the Swiss franc/mark</p>
<p>rate, lead manager Commerz Financial Products said.</p>
<p>COMMON TERMS:</p>
<p> EXERCISE PERIOD 06.FEB.97-02.MAR.98   PAYDATE	30.JAN.97</p>
<p> LISTING	   FFT/DDF		   MIN EXER LOT 100</p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
